OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump administration sues to block
OL,4,Acertification of upcoming Alaska
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolls suggest the race between Senator
OL,8,FSullivan and Democrat Mary Peltola is
OL,9,Ftight, with Peltola holding a narrow
OL,10,Flead in the final days before the 3
OL,11,FNovember vote.
OL,13,FThe US government wants the judge to
OL,14,Fbar the state from certifying the
OL,15,Fresults if Senator Sullivan loses by a
OL,16,Fmargin less than the other Sullivan.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
